  "description": "\"Jump into the New Year\" is a jump action game where you stay airborne by stepping on objects within the stage to welcome the New Year!\nLand before the year ends, and you'll be swallowed into another world—so be careful!\nKeep flying for about 3 seconds (or even over 30 seconds in some cases) and aim for a “Nice~” New Year!\n\n■Story\nThe protagonist, “Botti” is asked by a mysterious being called “Kamisama” in a dream to save the world.\nApparently, people have been oversleeping New Year's Eve lately and getting swallowed into another world...\nJoin Botti to defeat the root cause of this otherworldly trouble, the “Last Boss” and save the world!\n\n■Stages\nTowns, ruins, underwater, even space!?\nStep on various objects in all sorts of locations and let's ring in the New Year!\nBoss battle stages against the “Last Boss” and its minions, plus extra-challenging Hard Stages await!\n\n■Replay Value\nEarn scores based on objects stepped on or jumps performed.\nAccumulate scores to unlock mini-games!\nPlus, an encyclopedia recording stepped objects and 100 achievements to collect.\nPlay through every corner of the “Jump into the New Year” world!",
